.TH MINTTOYS-SETTINGS 1 2026-10-09 "MintToys" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
minttoys-settings \- set up MintToys' tools
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B minttoys-settings
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B minttoys-settings
opens the MintToys window. Its first page, the Overview, lists every tool with a switch
to turn it on or off; each tool also has a page of its own in the sidebar, where it is set
up: for Awake, what a click on the panel icon starts, and whether the screen stays on.
Escape closes the window, and starting it again brings the open window to the front.
.PP
The settings are kept by the MintToys service of the session, which starts on its own if
it is not running yet.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/minttoys/config.json
The settings, one section per module.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/minttoys/settings-window.ini
Whether the window has greeted you on its first open.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR minttoys (1)
